{"4892650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mascareri: Mask Making Simulator", "steam_appid": 4892650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4892650/extras/d30577a871452ecb37e75b6aab961073.avif?t=1785315468\" width=593 height=259 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Customers Await!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>You are a Venetian Mascareri that finds themselves to be in a long standing heated riveraly with your neighboring maskmakers. In a desperate plea to win the favor of passing customers you create stunning works that adhere to their particular and often peculiar tastes!</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Decorate Masks </strong></i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4892650/extras/e9d08467a724919e38753fa33d3dc09f.avif?t=1785315468\" width=1012 height=606 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Customize your masks with a variety of accessories at your disposal </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Color, rotate, and place objects however you want to create stunning masterpieces, or dreadful disasters. Customers can be picky, but make sure to stay true to your artistic vision.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>If the hustle and bustle of the venetian streets ever gets too much, simply retreat to your workshop in creative mode to enjoy your lovely craft in peace.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Listen to your Customers </strong></i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4892650/extras/9513ca5cb778feb4693589ffaa0bb12d.avif?t=1785315468\" width=1032 height=596 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Listen carefully to what your customers want, but their Attire might also point to preferences they lack to voice!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Dont worry, Customers will make it VERY clear if the do not like the mask once you give it to them ...</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Play against your friends </strong></i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4892650/extras/587aa63d1f57fc77dcd27fafbd045089.avif?t=1785315468\" width=1043 height=1049 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Put your mask making skills to the test and win over the customers before your rival does.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Learn from your opponents' mistakes and make sure you succeed where they failed!</strong></i> </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4892650/extras/d30577a871452ecb37e75b6aab961073.avif?t=1785315468\" width=593 height=259 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Customers Await!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>You are a Venetian Mascareri that finds themselves to be in a long standing heated riveraly with your neighboring maskmakers. In a desperate plea to win the favor of passing customers you create stunning works that adhere to their particular and often peculiar tastes!</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Decorate Masks </strong></i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4892650/extras/e9d08467a724919e38753fa33d3dc09f.avif?t=1785315468\" width=1012 height=606 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Customize your masks with a variety of accessories at your disposal </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Color, rotate, and place objects however you want to create stunning masterpieces, or dreadful disasters. Customers can be picky, but make sure to stay true to your artistic vision.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>If the hustle and bustle of the venetian streets ever gets too much, simply retreat to your workshop in creative mode to enjoy your lovely craft in peace.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Listen to your Customers </strong></i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4892650/extras/9513ca5cb778feb4693589ffaa0bb12d.avif?t=1785315468\" width=1032 height=596 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Listen carefully to what your customers want, but their Attire might also point to preferences they lack to voice!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Dont worry, Customers will make it VERY clear if the do not like the mask once you give it to them ...</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Play against your friends </strong></i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4892650/extras/587aa63d1f57fc77dcd27fafbd045089.avif?t=1785315468\" width=1043 height=1049 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Put your mask making skills to the test and win over the customers before your rival does.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Learn from your opponents' mistakes and make sure you succeed where they failed!</strong></i> </p>", "short_description": "You are a Venetian maskmaker in 1797. Craft stunning masks for picky patrons.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4892650/36